OL,3,GNEWSATall ship collides with bridge in
OL,4,Asevere gales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tall ship has collided with a harbour
OL,7,Fbridge in the Isle of Man's capital
OL,8,Fafter severe gales caused it to break
OL,9,Ffree of its moorings.
OL,11,FThe Department of Infrastructure said
OL,12,Fthe French brigantine La Malouine
OL,13,Fbecame stranded against the Millennium
OL,14,Flifting bridge in Douglas in the early
OL,15,Fhours.
OL,17,FA spokesperson said the one person who
OL,18,Fwas aboard at the time was safely
OL,19,Fbrought ashore.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
