OL,3,GNEWSATall ship collides with bridge in
OL,4,Asevere gales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said the ship damaged the bridge's
OL,7,Ftraffic lights, which "caused an
OL,8,Fobstruction", but the bridge had since
OL,9,Freopened. The ship was refloated on the
OL,10,Fafternoon tide and assisted to its
OL,11,Fmooring by a tug.
